{
  "screens": [
    { "name": "menu", "world_runs": false, "elements": [
      { "kind": "panel", "anchor": "center", "offset": [0, 0], "size": [620, 360], "color": "#10232dee" },
      { "kind": "label", "anchor": "center", "offset": [0, -118], "size": [560, 56], "text": "Потоп", "font": "ui", "font_size": 44, "color": "#f1ede4", "align": "center" },
      { "kind": "label", "anchor": "center", "offset": [0, -36], "size": [540, 96], "wrap": true, "text": "Мир ушёл под воду. У тебя плот из четырёх досок. Вылавливай обломки, ставь на плот паруса, сеть и таран и не попадайся тем, кто крупнее. Потопленное судно — тоже добыча.", "font": "ui", "font_size": 17, "color": "#b9c7cf", "align": "center" },
      { "kind": "label", "anchor": "center", "offset": [0, 44], "size": [540, 40], "wrap": true, "text": "W S — вперёд и назад, A D — руль: поворачивает только на ходу, щелчок по обломку — крюк, T — стройка, Esc — пауза", "font": "ui", "font_size": 14, "color": "#8fa3ad", "align": "center" },
      { "kind": "button", "anchor": "center", "offset": [0, 116], "size": [220, 52], "text": "Играть", "font": "ui", "font_size": 22, "text_color": "#ffffff", "color": "#2f7a55", "color_hover": "#3a9467", "color_pressed": "#255f43", "on_click": ["new_game", "game"] }
    ] },

    { "name": "game", "world_runs": true, "keys": { "Escape": ["show_screen", "pause"], "KeyT": ["run", "toggle_tuning"] }, "elements": [
      { "kind": "panel", "anchor": "top_left", "offset": [16, 16], "size": [440, 96], "color": "#10232dcc" },
      { "kind": "label", "anchor": "top_left", "offset": [32, 24], "size": [410, 28], "text": "{game.res_text}", "font": "ui", "font_size": 19, "color": "#f1ede4" },
      { "kind": "label", "anchor": "top_left", "offset": [32, 56], "size": [410, 22], "text": "{game.ship_text}", "font": "ui", "font_size": 14, "color": "#b9c7cf" },
      { "kind": "label", "anchor": "top_left", "offset": [32, 80], "size": [410, 22], "text": "{game.stats_text}", "font": "ui", "font_size": 14, "color": "#b9c7cf" },

      { "kind": "panel", "anchor": "bottom", "offset": [0, 52], "size": [600, 52], "color": "#10232ddd", "for": { "has": ["game", "notice"] } },
      { "kind": "label", "anchor": "bottom", "offset": [0, 56], "size": [576, 44], "wrap": true, "text": "{notice_text}", "font": "ui", "font_size": 15, "color": "#f0c27a", "align": "center", "for": { "has": ["game", "notice"] } },

      { "kind": "panel", "anchor": "bottom", "offset": [0, 10], "size": [920, 32], "color": "#10232daa" },
      { "kind": "label", "anchor": "bottom", "offset": [0, 14], "size": [900, 24], "text": "W S — вперёд и назад · A D — руль на ходу · щелчок по обломку — крюк · T — стройка · колесо — ближе и дальше · Esc — пауза", "font": "ui", "font_size": 14, "color": "#d9e4ea", "align": "center" },
      { "kind": "button", "anchor": "bottom_right", "offset": [16, 52], "size": [190, 48], "text": "Стройка (T)", "font": "ui", "font_size": 18, "text_color": "#ffffff", "color": "#2f7a55", "color_hover": "#3a9467", "color_pressed": "#255f43", "on_click": ["run", "toggle_tuning"], "for": { "has": ["game"], "without": ["tuning", "sunk"] } },

      { "kind": "panel", "anchor": "right", "offset": [16, 0], "size": [440, 640], "color": "#10232df2", "for": { "has": ["game", "tuning"] } },
      { "kind": "label", "anchor": "right", "offset": [36, -292], "size": [400, 32], "text": "Стройка плота", "font": "ui", "font_size": 22, "color": "#f1ede4", "for": { "has": ["game", "tuning"] } },
      { "kind": "label", "anchor": "right", "offset": [36, -262], "size": [400, 20], "text": "Море замерло, пока идёт стройка, паруса свёрнуты", "font": "ui", "font_size": 13, "color": "#8fa3ad", "for": { "has": ["game", "tuning"] } },
      { "kind": "list", "anchor": "right", "offset": [31, -20], "size": [410, 444], "for": { "has": ["part_kind", "listed"] }, "sort_by": "order", "row_height": 70, "gap": 4, "row": [
